    "body": "I should note that there are no cases like the one I am proposing disallowing in the parts of the web platform Gecko implements right now, and in fact Gecko's code generator fails out in that situation.  That is not what prompted me to file this issue; @foolip's comments in https://github.com/w3c/webidl2.js/issues/407 did, but it's a data point in terms of whether people would be affected in practice.",
